  "title": "Doing What We Can: Essential Information + MMC'89 #LAStrong Fire Relief Fund",
  "date": "2025-01-13T21:45:41.980Z",
  "description": "Learn how the MMC'89 Fire Relief Fund is providing crucial support to those affected by the devastating 2025 Los Angeles wildfires, and discover ways you can help your community in crisis.",
  "heroImage": {
    "src": "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/3ee52e_ba0a21e8791f45d0b785eb9c9dbb5634~mv2.webp/v1/fill/w_1200,h_675,al_c,q_90/file.jpg",
    "alt": "Doing What We Can: Essential Information + MMC'89 #LAStrong Fire Relief Fund"
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Introduction"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "Los Angeles is currently facing one of its most devastating wildfire seasons in history. With multiple fires raging across the region, including the Palisades and Eaton fires (Kenneth fires are now contained), our community faces unprecedented challenges."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "We have provided essential info here for anyone impacted by or wanting to help with the LA fires, and we have mobilized our <a target=\"_top\" href=\"https://www.pledge.to/lastrong\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><u>MMC'89 Fire Relief Fund</u></a> to help our AITC community around the world provide immediate assistance to those affected by this crisis."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "<strong>Please share this blog post widely - every bit of support matters right now.</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Current Crisis Overview (As of January 13, 2025)"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "- Death toll has risen to at least 24 people"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "Over 38,000 acres burned"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "More than 12,000 structures destroyed"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "About 92,000 people remain under mandatory evacuation orders"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "89,000 are under evacuation warnings"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "OVER 80,000 WITHOUT POWER"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "The MMC'89 Fire Relief Fund Response"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "In response to this unprecedented crisis, the Always In The Club Foundation has activated the MMC'89 Fire Relief Fund to provide:"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "Emergency shelter assistance"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "Essential supplies distribution"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "Support for displaced families"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "Coordination with local emergency services"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "Mental health support services"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "How You Can Help Right Now"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "1. **Immediate Financial Support**"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "Donate directly to the <a target=\"_top\" href=\"https://www.pledge.to/lastrong\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong><u>MMC'89 #LAStrong Fire Relief Fund</u></strong></a>"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "Every contribution helps provide essential resources to affected families"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "2. **Local Organizations Accepting Aid**"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.calfund.org/funds/wildfire-recovery-fund/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><u>California Community Foundation Wildfire Relief Fund</u></a>"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.redcross.org/local/california/los-angeles.html?srsltid=AfmBOoq0HC2SQ4AGWhSpj2v0jNJL17oRi3NkEN8IRsKQeC7-VSyfgEMq\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><u>American Red Cross Los Angeles Region</u></a>"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://supportlafd.org/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><u>Los Angeles Fire Department Foundation</u></a>"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "<a target=\"_top\" href=\"https://wck.org/relief/california-fires-jan25\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><u>World Central Kitchen</u></a>"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "<a target=\"_top\" href=\"https://www.directrelief.org/\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>Direct Relief</u></a>"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "<a target=\"_top\" href=\"https://donor.musicares.org/page/lafirerelief?utm_campaign=button_list_DonatetoSupportourDisasterReliefEfforts&utm_medium=referral&utm_source=later-linkinbio\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>MusiCares</u></a>"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "3. **Volunteer Opportunities**"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "Emergency shelters need volunteers"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "Supply distribution centers seeking help"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "Remote support opportunities available"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "You can also purchase an MMC'89 <a href=\"https://www.mickeymouseclubreunion.com/events/hashtags/LAStrong\" target=\"_blank\">#LAStrong</a> T-Shirt. 100% of the profits supports LA Fire relief."
    },
    {
